# Settings for the paid run, scripts/real_run.py. Nothing else reads them:
# the suite and scripts/offline_demo.py run without a key.
#
# The key is read ONLY from the file ENV_FILE names, never from the ambient
# environment, so a stray exported key cannot bill the wrong account. Keep
# that file outside every repository (e.g. ~/.secrets/ai.env, chmod 600):
#     ENV_FILE=~/.secrets/ai.env python scripts/real_run.py
# If you copy this template to .env inside the repository instead, point
# ENV_FILE at it; .env is ignored by git. Never commit it.

# In the file ENV_FILE names:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
